URL: http://simonwascher.info/ (in German)

the main part of my 'TradArchiv' tune collection now can be found under the following URL:
http://simonwascher.info/TradArchiv.htm
besides this collection, I made two books with traditional tunes especially collected to
fit for hurdy gurdy and/or bagpipes.

